    "en": "Official weather warnings of 38 European countries (MeteoAlarm): level, phenomenon, times.",
    "fr": "Vigilances météo officielles de 38 pays européens (MeteoAlarm) : niveau, phénomène, horaires.",
    "de": "Amtliche Wetterwarnungen aus 38 europäischen Ländern (MeteoAlarm): Stufe, Phänomen, Zeiten.",
    "es": "Avisos meteorológicos oficiales de 38 países europeos (MeteoAlarm): nivel, fenómeno, horarios."
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/guim31/gladys-meteoalarm:1.0.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.2.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guim31/gladys-meteoalarm/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["environment"],
